{"4344010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Lecture: Classroom 1.09", "steam_appid": 4344010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trying to reach Classroom 1.09.<br>Nobody is around, and the building feels suspended in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These familiar spaces repeat themselves in an endless loop.<br>To escape, you must trust your perception and question what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/eb1352f22d469cf59836ea799c42d3fd.poster.avif?t=1780641976\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/eb1352f22d469cf59836ea799c42d3fd.webm?t=1780641976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/eb1352f22d469cf59836ea799c42d3fd.mp4?t=1780641976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lecture: Classroom 1.09</strong> is a short first-person psychological experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings carefully.<br>If everything feels normal, choose the door on the right.<br>If something seems off, choose the one on the left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you manage to escape depends entirely on your attention to detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/7b79c52d3921e0638ab9a974a39c1472.poster.avif?t=1780641976\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/7b79c52d3921e0638ab9a974a39c1472.webm?t=1780641976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/7b79c52d3921e0638ab9a974a39c1472.mp4?t=1780641976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• An environment inspired by Italian Modernist architecture<br>• Multiple endings based on player choices<br>• Over 20 environmental anomalies affecting space, light, and sound<br>• An immersive atmosphere built with original assets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/11b603a7235500307ecfc907a2a969cd.poster.avif?t=1780641976\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/11b603a7235500307ecfc907a2a969cd.webm?t=1780641976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/11b603a7235500307ecfc907a2a969cd.mp4?t=1780641976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a claustrophobic and unsettling atmosphere that may cause discomfort or anxiety in some players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trying to reach Classroom 1.09.<br>Nobody is around, and the building feels suspended in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These familiar spaces repeat themselves in an endless loop.<br>To escape, you must trust your perception and question what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344010/extras/eb1352f22d469cf59836ea79